<title>HONG KONG: Shenzhen Int'l says in acquisition talk.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen Int'l says in acquisition talk.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optical products distributor Shenzhen International Holdings Ltd is in talks to buy stake of a company, it said in a statement issued through the stock exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Shenzhen International said &quot;confidential negotiations have been commenced relating to a proposed acquisition of the equity interest of a company by the company&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;The Board expected that the negotiations will soon be concluded,&quot; it said. Further announcement will be made if the negotiations finalised, it said. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
